<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113345" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰρᾰκ-ίας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάραξ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or
				<i>fit for a stake, pale,</i> or <i>palisade,</i> a species
			of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλαμος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.11.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				16.168
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιθύμαλλος ἄρρην,</span>
			<i>wood spurge, Euphorbia Sibthorpii,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.164
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				26.62
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαράκης</span> is f. l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a fish, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				20.7.1
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
